# Purchase Order live files

App DB in `database/purchase-order-generator/` (stock only). Plain / Packs / BTC / Uneek / Absolute Product Data + Tags + CL + ShipStation secrets are shared.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `database/shared/plain/Plain Database.xlsx` | Shared plain catalog (slips + grouping). `Supplier Name` filled 2026-09-09. |
| `database/shared/packs/Packs Database.xlsx` | Shared packs catalog |
| `database/purchase-order-generator/stock_levels_*.csv` | BTC free stock |
| `database/shared/shipstation_tags/ShipStation_Tags.xlsx` | Shared tags |
| `database/shared/btc_product_data/BTC_Product_Data.csv` | Shared BTC Product Data |
| `database/shared/uneek_product_data/Uneek_Product_Data.xlsx` | Shared Uneek Product Data |
| `database/shared/absolute_product_data/Absolute_Product_Data.xlsx` | Shared Absolute Product Data (babysuits only) |
| `database/shared/custom_label/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | BTC SKU |
| `Purchase Order Generator/assets/` | brand_logos / product_images |
| `Purchase Order Generator/output/` | Run outputs |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | ShipStation `REAL_API_*` |
| `Purchase Order Generator/config.py` | FTP/stock settings (never commit) |
